      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغمط</span></b>  <i>It continued; it kept,</i> or <i>clave;</i> (K;)
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغبط</span>. (TA.) Hence, (TA,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَغْمَطَتْ عَلَيْهِ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحُمَّى</span>, a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغبطت</span>, q. v. (S, TA.)

